ass=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57DBE3AF-023A-40C4-9015-D3DE0DB8CE30\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-A3C967FE-6865-44BA-B17C-09927049318D\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6D27D9E4-16B6-42D7-89CF-A8BD45199D70\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-24A7BA41-A220-4AF3-B0B6-07B75CDC51D8\">지금고민은</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-B52FC90F-E7C4-448C-BD0E-6DCCCBA2D9A0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-18651D75-9100-4CF6-826B-7CEA28E761C6\">건수가 너무 여러개라..</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-F91ACBB9-FB52-4C71-A2CD-18192371566F\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-652C8F94-5D13-4EA6-8998-EDA6D6DDFE0D\">폐업신고하고 바로 부실우려로 갈지 (우려로가도 차주로가야해요)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-35341345-54FC-4CE6-89BD-1AFE75AB0CE7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-5C97A948-254F-43AE-97C2-805BF9332288\">어차피오는 추심 여러개 다받고 모든납부를 하지않으면서 90일참아서 부실차주로 갈지 너무 고민입니다ㅠㅠ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-75EDB057-C44E-4361-ADCC-F8BBCD847DF2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-3CAC48C7-4E11-4ED6-8E31-67FBDE24242D\">다들 의견한번씩만 주시면 감사하겠습니다..</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0C7C7792-11BB-401C-B27A-DDB8C33F96CB\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system   \" id=\"SE-9D04C4DF-7E83-4A4D-A6AE-B9DF360357BF\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                   